From freebsd-alpha  Sun Dec 05 04:41:01 1999
From: Jason Thorpe <thorpej () nas ! nasa ! gov>
Date: Sun, 05 Dec 1999 04:41:01 +0000
To: freebsd-alpha
Subject: Re: Q: Compaq, *BSD and 'Linux-only' AlphaBIOS (fwd)
